<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>오둥이 번호 뽑기 - 선생님용 랜덤 뽑기</title>
    <!-- 파비콘 설정 -->
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 200 200'%3E%3Crect width='200' height='200' rx='40' fill='%23FFA400'/%3E%3Cpath d='M 18 205 C 24 125, 38 52, 100 52 C 162 52, 176 125, 182 205 Z' fill='%23FFFFFF' stroke='%23000000' stroke-width='9' stroke-linejoin='round'/%3E%3Cellipse cx='85' cy='93' rx='14' ry='15' fill='%23FFFFFF' stroke='%23000000' stroke-width='6.5'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='85' cy='95' r='4.5' fill='%23000000'/%3E%3Cellipse cx='115' cy='93' rx='14' ry='15' fill='%23FFFFFF' stroke='%23000000' stroke-width='6.5'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='115' cy='95' r='4.5' fill='%23000000'/%3E%3Cpath d='M 52 126 C 52 110, 148 110, 148 126 C 148 142, 52 142, 52 126 Z' fill='%23FFA400' stroke='%23000000' stroke-width='6.5' stroke-linejoin='round'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/galmuri@latest/dist/galmuri.css');

        @font-face {
            font-family: 'Galmuri11';
            src: url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/projectnoonnu/2506-1@1.0/Galmuri11-Bold.woff2') format('woff2');
            font-weight: 700;
            font-display: swap;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Galmuri11', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            background-color: #2c1608;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(22, 16, 38, 1) 0%, rgba(132, 53, 10, 0.9) 60%, rgba(217, 119, 6, 1) 100%);
            background-size: 28px 28px, 28px 28px, 100% 100%;
            background-attachment: fixed;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .arcade-title {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffe047 0%, #ff9900 55%, #ff5e00 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            filter: drop-shadow(0px 3px 0px #7c2d12) drop-shadow(0px 5px 0px #1e1035);
        }

        /* 인형뽑기 기계 유리창 내부 */
        .claw-window {
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, #2a2152 0%, #140f29 100%);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
        }

        /* 크레인 애니메이션 */
        #crane-carriage {
            transition: left 0.38s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
        }
        #crane-cable {
            transition: height 0.35s ease-in-out;
        }
        /* 다수 인원 연속 뽑기 시 고속 모드 */
        .crane-fast #crane-carriage {
            transition: left 0.14s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1) !important;
        }
        .crane-fast #crane-cable {
            transition: height 0.13s ease-in-out !important;
        }
        .claw-arm-left, .claw-arm-right {
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
            transform-origin: top center;
        }
        .claw-open .claw-arm-left { transform: rotate(28deg); }
        .claw-open .claw-arm-right { transform: rotate(-28deg); }
        .claw-closed .claw-arm-left { transform: rotate(-6deg); }
        .claw-closed .claw-arm-right { transform: rotate(6deg); }

        @keyframes dollIdle {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(var(--rot, 0deg)); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-3px) rotate(var(--rot, 0deg)); }
        }
        .doll-pile-item {
            animation: dollIdle 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes popIn {
            0% { transform: scale(0.6) translateY(15px); opacity: 0; }
            80% { transform: scale(1.06) translateY(-2px); opacity: 1; }
            100% { transform: scale(1) translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
        }
        .animate-pop-in {
            animation: popIn 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 7px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #140f29; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #4c3d8f; border: 1px solid #140f29; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col selection:bg-amber-400 selection:text-slate-950">

    <!-- 상단 바 -->
    <header class="max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto px-4 pt-4 pb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-[#FFA400] flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-black shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#000]">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" class="w-full h-full" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <rect width="200" height="200" fill="#FFA400" />
                    <path d="M 18 205 C 24 125, 38 52, 100 52 C 162 52, 176 125, 182 205 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="9" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                    <ellipse cx="85" cy="93" rx="14" ry="15" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="6.5" />
                    <circle cx="85" cy="95" r="4.5" fill="#000000" />
                    <ellipse cx="115" cy="93" rx="14" ry="15" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="6.5" />
                    <circle cx="115" cy="95" r="4.5" fill="#000000" />
                    <path d="M 52 126 C 52 110, 148 110, 148 126 C 148 142, 52 142, 52 126 Z" fill="#FFA400" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="6.5" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h1 class="arcade-title text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-wider">오둥이 번호 뽑기</h1>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-amber-300/90">TEACHER'S ARCADE PICKER</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 우측 컨트롤: 단축키 안내 & 효과음 토글 -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button onclick="toggleModal('shortcut-modal', true)" class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-[#1c1738] border-2 border-[#3b3363] hover:border-amber-400 text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 text-xs font-bold transition-colors cursor-pointer">
                ⌨️ 단축키
            </button>
            <button id="sound-toggle-btn" onclick="toggleSound()" class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-[#121629] border-2 border-[#4ade80] text-[#4ade80] text-xs font-bold shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(74,222,128,0.2)] cursor-pointer transition-all">
                🔊 효과음 ON
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 모드 전환 탭 버튼 -->
    <nav class="max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto px-4 mt-1 mb-5">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 border-b-2 border-[#3b3363] pb-3">
            <button onclick="switchMainTab('claw')" id="nav-tab-claw" class="px-4 py-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold border-2 border-[#4ade80] bg-[#4ade80] text-[#121629] shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(74,222,128,0.4)] cursor-pointer transition-all">
                🕹️ 번호 뽑기 (1~N명)
            </button>
            <button onclick="switchMainTab('group')" id="nav-tab-group" class="px-4 py-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold border-2 border-[#3b3363] bg-[#1e193b] text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-400 hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-all">
                👥 모둠(조) 편성
            </button>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- 메인 영역 -->
    <main class="flex-grow max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto px-4 pb-16">

        <!-- [탭 1] 인형뽑기 화면 (좌측: 인형뽑기 기계 / 우측: 모든 설정 및 결과) -->
        <div id="view-claw" class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start">

            <!-- [좌측 6칸] 오둥이 인형뽑기 유리창 머신 -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-[#1c1738] border-[4px] border-amber-400 shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(251,191,36,0.25)] p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <!-- 머신 상단 상태바 -->
                    <div class="bg-[#120e24] border-2 border-amber-400/70 py-2.5 px-4 mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-amber-300">★ ODUNG NUMBER PICKER ★</span>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 font-bold">남은 캡슐: <span id="machine-ball-count" class="text-amber-400">25</span>개</span>
                            <span id="machine-status-text" class="text-xs text-[#4ade80] font-bold">READY</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 유리창 내부 (크레인 + 인원수에 맞춘 캡슐 더미) -->
                    <div id="claw-window-box" class="claw-window relative w-full h-[380px] sm:h-[440px] border-2 border-[#3b3363] overflow-hidden select-none">
                        <!-- 상단 레일 -->
                        <div class="w-full h-3.5 bg-slate-700 border-b-2 border-black relative z-20 flex justify-around items-center">
                            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-slate-400 rounded-full"></span>
                            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-slate-400 rounded-full"></span>
                            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-slate-400 rounded-full"></span>
                            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-slate-400 rounded-full"></span>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 움직이는 크레인 본체 -->
                        <div id="crane-carriage" class="absolute top-3.5 z-20 flex flex-col items-center -translate-x-1/2" style="left: 50%;">
                            <div class="w-14 h-6 bg-amber-400 border-2 border-black shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#000] flex items-center justify-center">
                                <div class="w-6 h-2 bg-red-500 border border-black"></div>
                            </div>
                            <div id="crane-cable" class="w-1.5 bg-slate-300 border-x border-black" style="height: 24px;"></div>
                            <div id="claw-head" class="relative flex flex-col items-center claw-open">
                                <div class="w-8 h-5 bg-slate-200 border-2 border-black rounded-t-md z-10 flex items-center justify-center">
                                    <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-amber-500 rounded-full"></div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="relative w-24 h-14 -mt-1 flex justify-center">
                                    <svg class="claw-arm-left w-10 h-14 -mr-2" viewBox="0 0 40 56" fill="none">
                                        <path d="M28 4 L8 26 L18 50 L25 46 L17 26 L33 9 Z" fill="#cbd5e1" stroke="#000" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                                    </svg>
                                    <svg class="claw-arm-right w-10 h-14 -ml-2" viewBox="0 0 40 56" fill="none">
                                        <path d="M12 4 L32 26 L22 50 L15 46 L23 26 L7 9 Z" fill="#cbd5e1" stroke="#000" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                                    </svg>
                                </div>

                                <!-- 집게에 잡힌 캡슐 (뽑는 도중에는 번호/이름 비공개 처리) -->
                                <div id="grabbed-capsule" class="hidden -mt-9 flex flex-col items-center z-30">
                                    <div id="grabbed-capsule-inner" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-white border-[3px] border-black shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.95)] flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden">
                                        <!-- JS로 오둥이 캡슐 SVG 렌더링 -->
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 좌측 하단 배출구 표시 -->
                        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-24 h-28 bg-[#0d0a1a] border-t-4 border-r-4 border-[#3b3363] z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-amber-400 font-bold tracking-wider">DROP ZONE</span>
                            <span class="text-lg mt-0.5">⬇️</span>
                            <span id="drop-counter-badge" class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5 font-bold">0 / 1</span>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 바닥 캡슐 더미 영역 -->
                        <div id="doll-pile-container" class="absolute bottom-2 left-24 right-2 pl-4 h-44 flex flex-wrap-reverse content-start items-end justify-center gap-1.5 z-10">
                            <!-- JS로 인원수에 맞춰 오둥이 캡슐 렌더링 -->
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 머신 하단 레트로 데코 바 -->
                <div class="mt-3.5 bg-[#120e24] border-2 border-[#3b3363] py-2 px-3 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-bold">
                    <span>🕹️ SPACEBAR : 뽑기 실행</span>
                    <span class="text-amber-300">INSERT COIN • FREE PLAY</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- [우측 6칸] 모든 설정 옵션 및 당첨 결과 영역 -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col gap-4">

                <!-- 1) 몇 명 뽑을지 선택지 + 뽑기 시작 / 한 번에 뽑기 버튼 -->
                <div class="bg-[#1c1738] border-[3px] border-amber-400 p-4 flex flex-col gap-3">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-300 font-bold">🎯 몇 명을 뽑을까요?</span>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">(단축키 숫자 1~5)</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                        <button onclick="setDrawCount(1)" class="draw-cnt-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold border-2 border-amber-400 bg-amber-400 text-[#121629] cursor-pointer" data-cnt="1">1명</button>
                        <button onclick="setDrawCount(2)" class="draw-cnt-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold border-2 border-[#3b3363] bg-[#1e193b] text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-400 cursor-pointer" data-cnt="2">2명</button>
                        <button onclick="setDrawCount(3)" class="draw-cnt-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold border-2 border-[#3b3363] bg-[#1e193b] text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-400 cursor-pointer" data-cnt="3">3명</button>
                        <button onclick="setDrawCount(4)" class="draw-cnt-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold border-2 border-[#3b3363] bg-[#1e193b] text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-400 cursor-pointer" data-cnt="4">4명</button>
                        <button onclick="setDrawCount(5)" class="draw-cnt-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold border-2 border-[#3b3363] bg-[#1e193b] text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-400 cursor-pointer" data-cnt="5">5명</button>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 ml-auto">
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-bold">직접:</span>
                            <input type="number" id="custom-draw-count" min="1" max="50" value="1" onchange="setDrawCount(this.value)" class="w-14 px-2 py-1.5 bg-[#120e24] border-2 border-[#3b3363] text-amber-300 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-center focus:outline-none focus:border-amber-400" title="직접 입력">
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 font-bold">명</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex gap-2.5 pt-1">
                        <button id="start-claw-btn" onclick="startClawSequence(false)" class="flex-1 py-3 bg-[#4ade80] hover:brightness-110 active:translate-y-0.5 text-[#121629] font-bold text-sm sm:text-base border-2 border-black shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#000] cursor-pointer transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5">
                            <span>🕹️ 뽑기 시작!</span>
                        </button>
                        <button id="instant-claw-btn" onclick="startClawSequence(true)" class="px-4 py-3 bg-amber-400 hover:brightness-110 active:translate-y-0.5 text-[#121629] font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm border-2 border-black shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#000] cursor-pointer transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-1 shrink-0" title="집게 왕복 없이 한 번에 결과를 뽑습니다">
                            <span>⚡ 한 번에 뽑기</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 2) 당첨 결과 확인 영역 -->
                <div class="bg-[#1c1738] border-[3px] border-[#4ade80] p-4">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b-2 border-[#3b3363] pb-2 mb-2.5">
                        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#4ade80] flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <span>🎉</span> 당첨 결과
                        </h2>
                        <span id="turn-progress-badge" class="text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-[#120e24] border border-[#4ade80]/50 text-[#4ade80] font-bold">
                            대기 중
                        </span>
                    </div>

                    <div id="current-winners-box" class="min-h-[84px] max-h-[150px] overflow-y-auto bg-[#120e24] border-2 border-[#3b3363] p-2.5 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 content-start gap-2">
                        <div class="col-span-full py-4 text-center">
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
                                인원을 선택하고 <span class="text-[#4ade80] font-bold">[뽑기 시작!]</span>을 누르면 당첨 순서대로 표시됩니다!
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 3) 중복 방지 & 이미 뽑힌 학생 -->
                <div class="bg-[#1c1738] border-[3px] border-purple-400 p-4">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b-2 border-[#3b3363] pb-2 mb-2.5">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-purple-300">📦 중복 방지 및 뽑힌 명단</h3>
                            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300 mt-0.5">
                                남은 인원: <span id="remaining-count" class="text-amber-400 font-bold">25</span>명 / 출석: <span id="total-present-count" class="text-white font-bold">25</span>명
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <label class="flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer bg-[#120e24] border border-[#3b3363] px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold">
                                <input type="checkbox" id="no-repeat-checkbox" checked onchange="handleOptionChange()" class="accent-amber-400 w-3.5 h-3.5 cursor-pointer">
                                <span class="text-amber-300">중복 제외</span>
                            </label>
                            <button onclick="resetPickedHistory()" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-red-500/20 border border-red-400 text-red-300 hover:bg-red-500 hover:text-white text-xs font-bold cursor-pointer transition-colors" title="이미 뽑힌 기록 초기화 (R)">
                                ↻ 초기화
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="picked-history-list" class="h-[68px] overflow-y-auto bg-[#120e24] border border-[#3b3363] p-2 flex flex-wrap content-start gap-1.5">
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-500">아직 뽑힌 학생이 없습니다.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 4) 출석 / 결석 빠른 체크 & 명단 수정 -->
                <div class="bg-[#1c1738] border-[3px] border-sky-400 p-4">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-sky-300">✅ 출석 / 결석 체크</h3>
                            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300">클릭 시 결석 처리되어 캡슐에서 제외됩니다.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <button onclick="setAllPresent()" class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-[#120e24] border border-[#4ade80] text-[#4ade80] hover:bg-[#4ade80] hover:text-[#121629] text-xs font-bold cursor-pointer">
                                전원 출석
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="toggleModal('roster-modal', true)" class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-sky-400 text-[#121629] text-xs font-bold hover:brightness-110 cursor-pointer">
                                ✏️ 명단 수정
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="attendance-grid" class="grid grid-cols-5 sm:grid-cols-6 gap-1.5 max-h-[150px] overflow-y-auto p-2 bg-[#120e24] border border-[#3b3363]">
                        <!-- JS로 학생 출석/결석 버튼 렌더링 -->
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- [탭 2] 모둠(조) 편성 전용 화면 -->
        <section id="view-group" class="hidden bg-[#1c1738] border-[3px] border-amber-400/90 shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(251,191,36,0.2)] p-4 sm:p-6">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#3b3363] pb-4 mb-5">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-amber-300 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span>👥</span> 자동 모둠(조) 편성기
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 mt-1">
